---
import "../styles/style.css";
import FilmHeader from "../components/FilmHeader.astro";
import footerData from "../data/footer.json";
---

<html lang="it">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Pixar Viz — Archivio 3D e collection dedicata ai film Pixar. Informazioni sul progetto e sul team."
		/>
		<title>About — Pixar Viz</title>
	</head>

	<body>
		<div id="custom-cursor"></div>
		<FilmHeader />

		<main class="about-page">
			<div class="about-left">
				<div class="about-grid">
					<span class="about-label">Projects:</span>
					<span class="about-value"
						>Politecnico di Milano <br /> Cultura dell'immagine digitale <br /> A.A.
						2025/2026</span
					>

					<span class="about-label">Group:</span>
					<div class="about-value">
						{footerData.Nomi.map(nome => <div>{nome}</div>)}
					</div>

					<span class="about-label">Professors:</span>
					<span class="about-value"
						>Maria Grazia Mattei <br /> Alice Polerà</span
					>
				</div>

				<div class="about-logo">
					<img src="/title.svg" alt="Pixar 3D Archive" />
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about-right">
				<p class="about-text">
					This project was born from a simple curiosity: what happens if we look
					at Pixar not just as a studio that tells stories, but as a place where
					technology quietly evolves film after film? Each movie carries its own
					narrative world, yet behind the scenes it also contains a technical
					challenge, an algorithm invented from scratch, a new way to simulate
					light, water, hair or emotion. By mapping these innovations, the
					website turns the Pixar filmography into a kind of technological
					timeline where creativity and engineering constantly push each other
					forward. Seeing the films arranged this way reveals something that
					often stays invisible: Pixar’s identity is shaped as much by technical
					breakthroughs as by storytelling. Innovation is not just a tool they
					use; it is a force that opens new narrative possibilities and reshapes
					what animation can become. The visualization is ultimately a reminder
					that every leap in technology is also a leap in imagination, and that
					the magic of these films lies in the space where the two meet.
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>

		<script>
			// Custom cursor
			const cursor = document.getElementById("custom-cursor");

			document.addEventListener("mousemove", e => {
				if (!cursor) return;

				cursor.style.left = e.clientX + "px";
				cursor.style.top = e.clientY + "px";

				// Temporarily hide cursor to detect element underneath
				cursor.style.pointerEvents = "none";
				const elementUnderCursor = document.elementFromPoint(
					e.clientX,
					e.clientY
				);
				cursor.style.pointerEvents = "none"; // Keep it none

				// Check if it's an interactive element
				if (elementUnderCursor && elementUnderCursor !== cursor) {
					const isInteractive =
						elementUnderCursor.tagName === "BUTTON" ||
						elementUnderCursor.tagName === "A" ||
						elementUnderCursor.tagName === "INPUT" ||
						elementUnderCursor.tagName === "SELECT" ||
						elementUnderCursor.tagName === "TEXTAREA" ||
						elementUnderCursor.closest("button, a, input, select, textarea");

					if (isInteractive) {
						cursor.classList.add("hover");
					} else {
						cursor.classList.remove("hover");
					}
				} else {
					cursor.classList.remove("hover");
				}
			});
		</script>

		<style>
			body {
				min-height: 100vh;
				margin: 0;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.about-page {
				padding: 6.5rem 1.5rem 2rem;
				margin: 0 auto;
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
				gap: 1rem;
				flex: 1;
			}

			.about-left {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				justify-content: space-between;
			}

			.about-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
				gap: 1rem;
				align-items: start;
			}

			.about-logo {
				width: 100%;
				margin-top: 2rem;
			}

			.about-logo img {
				width: 100%;
				height: auto;
				display: block;
			}

			.about-label {
				grid-column: 1 / 3;
				font-family: var(--font-family);
				font-size: var(--font-size);
				font-weight: 600;
				color: #000000;
				line-height: 1.4;
			}

			.about-value {
				grid-column: 3 / 13;
				font-family: var(--font-family);
				font-size: var(--font-size);
				font-weight: 400;
				color: #000000;
				line-height: 1.4;
			}

			.about-right {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.about-text {
				font-family: var(--font-family);
				font-size: var(--font-size);
				font-weight: 400;
				color: #000000;
				line-height: 1.6;
				margin: 0;
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.about-page {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					padding: 5rem 1rem 2rem;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
